</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
<figure id="S5.T5" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Minimum L2 loss of Cifar 10 and 100 image generation task.</figcaption>
<table id="S5.T5.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S5.T5.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
